Error [E1109]: partial `#layout(columnar: …)` isn't supported yet
  --> tests/ui/layout_columnar_partial.jet:1:9
    |
  1 | #layout(columnar: x, y)
    |         ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: v1 supports whole-struct columnar only — every field becomes a column
 Fix: write `#layout(columnar)` to convert the whole struct
